"This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE 7.17 pm IST (1.47 pm GMT) - Well, well, the rain seems to have completely stopped now and the covers are coming off. We are now waiting for an official update regarding the ground conditions. The start shouldn't be that far away now.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:50:59+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE 7.12 pm IST (1.42 pm GMT) - We are hearing that the rain has reduced considerably. The heavy showers though would have taken a huge toll on the ground but the drainage system at the stadium is one of the very best in the world. Stay tuned for further updates.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:49:33+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "The game is set to begin\u00a0although, some dark clouds are hovering around. Let's hope the rain gods show some mercy.\u00a0Right then, the South African players take the field. Followed by Ruturaj Gaikwad\u00a0and Ishan Kishan\u00a0who walk out to open for India. Well, the rains start to come down and the ground staff sprints on the field. The covers are coming on. Well, we might've to wait a bit longer as the rain is coming down a lot more heavily...", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:31:48+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Rahul Dravid, the Head Coach of India is in for a chat. He says his journey has been quite exciting. Mentions that he had to work with six captains over the past which was not his plan at all. It has been challennging but great fun as well. Adds as a group they are working really well and been able to try out different combinations. Adds, a lot of more youngsters got to showcase their skills and lot of them made goods. Ends by saying these are absolutely good signs for India Cricket.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:27:08+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Rishabh Pant, the captain of India is in for a chat. He says\u00a0he has tried practicing the toss but it is certainly not helping him at all. Mentions it looks like a good wicket and the team would aim to score anywhere near 180. Adds that the team seems to be confident. Ends by saying they are coming in with the same side.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:10:42+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Keshav Maharaj, the skipper of South Africa,\u00a0says they will have a bowl first. Mentions that the conditions might help the seamers early on and it might get easier for batting later on. Informs that Temba is missing out but there are a few other changes, so they have an extra batter tonight. Adds that they would like to bowl on a good line and length and hope to restrict the opposition to a decent score.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:10:13+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "India (Unchanged Playing XI) - Ruturaj Gaikwad, Ishan Kishan, Shreyas Iyer, Rishabh Pant (C) (WK), Hardik Pandya, Dinesh Karthik, Axar Patel, Harshal Patel, Bhuvneshwar Kumar, Avesh Khan, Yuzvendra Chahal.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:06:31+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "South Africa (Playing XI) - Quinton de Kock (WK), Reeza Hendricks\u00a0(In for Temba Bavuma),\u00a0Rassie van der Dussen, Heinrich Klaasen, David Miller, Tristan Stubbs\u00a0(In for Marco Jansen),\u00a0Dwaine Pretorius, Keshav Maharaj (C), Anrich Nortje, Kagiso Rabada\u00a0(In for Tabraiz Shamsi), Lungi Ngidi.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:12:31+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "TOSS - The coin goes up and lands in favour of South Africa. They have opted to FIELD first.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:04:04+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "PITCH REPORT - Deep Dasgupta is pitchside to take us through the wicket.\u00a0He says that the venue has been a nightmare for the bowlers and the dimensions play a huge role in that. Adds that the pitch is nice and firm with good carry but currently there are a few cracks and the smaller cracks are a bit wobbly which might help the spinners as well. Mentions that it has been mostly overcast over the last few days and hence chances of dew are very less. The sides have generally opted to chase here and the same should follow tonight as well.", "Timestamp": "2022-06-19T13:01:42+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "InningNo": "1", "BattingTeam_Id": "4", "BattingTeam": "India", "BowlingTeam_Id": "7", "BowlingTeam": "South Africa", "GameCode": "insa06192022205745", "MatchId": "205745", "Timestamp": "06/19/2022T22:28:02+05:30", "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 45, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:19:32 AM"}}}